    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApproximately 16 acres (6.47 Ha) enjoying spectacular scenic area overlooking Lough Gill.\nLocated approximately 9.5km from Sligo Town this land is currently primarily in woodland with grazing pastures and is set in an area of outstanding natural beauty.\nThere is access to the main part of the lands from the upper road as well as strip of land running to the lower road and lakeshore and is comprised in land registry folios SL11303, SL11305 & SL667F\nAlong the lake, Parkes Castle is located very nearby, Dromahair Village is approxinmatly 9.5km and Sligo itself is approximatly 12min by car.\nFull details available on request."
      },
